 "strings": {
  "As I surmised...": "",
  "But as I continued to investigate, I found that what you said had weight. So of course I couldn't refuse.": "",
  "You're as honest as they come, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Even so, I'm happy you believed in me despite your suspicion.": "",
  "Well, put in a request if you ever need anything else.": "",
  "Certainly. We do make quite an excellent pair.": "",
  "I dunno about that...": "",
  "...Are you saying we'll continue working together as the Kamurocho Calamity Busters!?": "",
  "Whoa whoa, that's not quite what I meant lol": "",
  "Ah. Perhaps I let my emotions get the best of me.": "",
  "Lol I dunno about that...": "",
  "Are you sure? You don't want to form the Kamurocho Calamity Busters with me?": "",
  "Well... I'll think about it =P": "",
  "Yagami-san. Do you have a moment?": "",
  "What's going on, Amane-san?": "",
  "I happened to pass by you on the street, and that's when I saw it. A calamity. It was written all over you.": "",
  "What? On me? Seriously?": "",
  "Yes, there's no doubt about it. It was... a cow calamity.": "",
  "A cow?": "",
  "Indeed. Soon you will be confronted by a cow. You must defeat it promptly.": "",
  "So you're saying I'm going to be attacked by a cow? In Kamurocho?": "",
  "That is one way of interpreting it.": "",
  "Seriously? But how am I supposed to defeat it?": "",
  "In return for watching over me, so will I do the same for you. Once the calamity shows itself, we can tackle it immediately.": "",
  "There's no need to wait in fear until the calamity arrives. We must go on the offensive. Is that not what you would do?": "",
  "Maybe...": "",
  "In other words, we're gonna lure out the calamity and defeat it?": "",
  "Exactly. Instead of getting taken by surprise, we'll prepare our counterattack.": "",
  "Therefore, we should go about the city in search of this burdensome beast. As long as your mind is clear, even calamities can be vanquished!": "",
  "All right, then.": "",
  "If you say so...": "",
  "Let's meet up somewhere. I guess Theater Square would be easiest.": "",
  "Sure. I think there was a bowling alley in that location, so let's meet in front of it.": "",
  "(...Well, I guess I can consider this a date.)": "",
  "(A weird one, to be sure, but a date nonetheless.)": "",
  "I appreciate you coming along with me today, Yagami-san. Though I am relieved nothing bad happened, please be aware that calamity still looms above you.": "",
  "Yeah, I'll be careful.": "",
  "I'll call you again soon.": "",
  "Let's go on a date again.": "",
  "Let's put an end to it soon.": "",
  "Certainly. Because watching for invisible cows is so romantic. Ahaha.": "",
  "Yes, I hope to do so as well.": "",
  "Hello there, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey, what's up?": "",
  "Today, I saw an elderly man with a sign of calamity. I followed your advice from the other day, and I managed to get him to listen to my warning.": "",
  "I'm glad it helped!": "",
  "That was all you, Amane-san.": "",
  "I'm glad it helped.": "",
  "Yes, I can't thank you enough.": "",
  "That was all you, Amane-san. I didn't say anything that useful.": "",
  "By the way, what kind of sign did you see?": "",
  "An ominous \"sign of the blades.\"": "",
  "I hope that he follows my warning and stays careful.": "",
  "Did it seem like he believed you?": "",
  "I'm not sure. He seemed half-convinced, but did say that he'll be careful.": "",
  "Let's hope he keeps his word.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Has the calamity appeared since the last time we met?": "",
  "Nope, not at all. Not even the first letter \"c\" of it.": "",
  "How strange. I wonder how long this drama will continue to drag out...": "",
  "Well, as long as the calamity doesn't appear, it's all good, no?": "",
  "No. Bad luck accumulates over time, like filth.": "",
  "I don't like the sound of that.": "",
  "Exactly. I think it's best to get rid of the bad luck before something terrible happens.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Let's meet up again. Let's lure out that cow calamity.": "",
  "I'm busy right now.": "",
  "All right. Can we meet at Theater Square, then? In front of the bowling spot like last time?": "",
  "Certainly. I'll head over there right now.": "",
  "Sorry, I'm a little busy right now.": "",
  "I see. In that case, please let me know when you're available.": "",
  "Hey, remember that outfit I got you? I was thinking, I'd love to see you in it...": "",
  "Does this have something to do with the calamity?": "",
  "Nah, I'm just super curious.": "",
  "Then I'll give it some thought.": "",
  "(I hope she goes for it.)": "",
  "Yagami-san. I had an excellent time thanks to you.": "",
  "What about the cow calamity?": "",
  "I'm glad you had fun, but was it really okay to neglect the cow calamity?": "",
  "I made sure to watch out for that, too.": "",
  "Me too. I had fun with you.": "",
  "I'm relieved to hear that. It's all thanks to the cow, hm?": "",
  "Hopefully nothing too bad happens.": "",
  "Well, as long as the calamity existed in the first place, it will most definitely happen. Please do not let your guard down.": "",
  "Okay. I'll be careful.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Do you remember the elderly man who listened to my prophecy?": "",
  "The \"sign of the blades\" guy?": "",
  "The arsonist?": "",
  "Who again?": "",
  "Sorry. Who was that again?": "",
  "So you don't remember at all...": "",
  "My bad. Who's this old man you're talking about?": "",
  "As I mentioned before, he bore the \"sign of the blades.\" He told me he'd be careful after hearing my advice.": "",
  "Oh, that guy. I remember now. What about him?": "",
  "No, the arsonist wasn't elderly. Besides, he was little more than a criminal who refused to heed my warnings.": "",
  "Oh, okay...": "",
  "I'm talking about the elderly man who bore the \"sign of the blades.\" He told me he'd be careful after hearing my advice.": "",
  "It's that guy with the \"sign of the blades,\" right? He told you he'd be careful even though he only seemed half-convinced.": "",
  "Yes! That man actually came to thank me today.": "",
  "The calamity occurred as I predicted, and he escaped death because he stayed careful. He even requested that I read his fortune again.": "",
  "Wow, that's amazing.": "",
  "This is the first time someone other than you acknowledged my power, so I'm extremely happy!": "",
  "Hopefully more people get their heads straight and take your advice from now on.": "",
  "One can only hope!": "",
  "Yagami-san. Has the cow calamity manifested itself to you?": "",
  "In that case, would you like to meet with me again?": "",
  "Are you asking me out on a date?": "",
  "Sorry, I'm busy right now.": "",
  "I see. In that case, please get back to me when you're available.": "",
  "Are you going to consider it as a date?": "",
  "Yeah, I have been since the beginning.": "",
  "Very well. Then I'll go with that intention in mind as well.": "",
  "Sweet! Then I'll meet you in front of the bowling spot in Theater Square, as usual.": "",
  "Yagami-san. I'm back home from work.": "",
  "You were telling the fortunes of all the yakuza members, right?": "",
  "Yes. Everyone was haunted by some form of calamity or another.": "",
  "Well, they are involved in organized crime, after all.": "",
  "I'm worried about your safety.": "",
  "Are you gonna to be okay dealing with those sorts of customers? It sounds kinda dangerous to me...": "",
  "I'll be fine. They're all good people.": "",
  "But still.": "",
  "I'm worried about your safety, especially being involved with those kinds of people.": "",
  "Besides, I saved their patriarch's life, so I'm sure the rest of them wouldn't lay a finger on me.": "",
  "I see. But like you always say, you can never be too careful, right?": "",
  "You're right. Thank you for your concern.": "",
  "I hope you continue to be careful with the cow calamity as well.": "",
  "Yeah, thanks for the warning.": "",
  "Yagami-san, are you dating anyone right now?": "",
  "Huh? Why do you ask?": "",
  "Well, since we see each other quite often, I'd feel bad for your girlfriend if you had one.": "",
  "I'm single.": "",
  "I'm taken.": "",
  "Don't worry. I'm still single.": "",
  "Is that so? Well, that's certainly a relief.": "",
  "(Why did I just lie?)": "",
  "Actually, I am dating someone.": "",
  "Oh, so you have a girlfriend, then.": "",
  "I wouldn't worry, though. We have a business relationship, right?": "",
  "I suppose we do. Then I guess it's all right.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Has the cow calamity appeared since we last spoke?": "",
  "Nope. Nothing as usual.": "",
  "In that case, we should meet once more. This time I will surely lure out the calamity!": "",
  "Okay, let's meet up.": "",
  "Does Theater Square work for you? You know, the usual bowling spot?": "",
  "Yes! I'll be waiting!": "",
  "I see. In that case, please get back to me whenever you're available.": "",
  "Oh hey, remember that outfit I got you? I'd love to see you in that.": "",
  "It's not as though kimonos are easy to put on...": "",
  "But... As I owe you a great debt, I shall indulge this request.": "",
  "Cool! You look great in it, by the way.": "",
  "(Her normal outfit is just fine.)": "",
  "Yagami-san. Sorry to worry you today. At least our date was enjoyable!": "",
  "Let's go out again sometime.": "",
  "Yes, let's!": "",
  "Are you feeling any better?": "",
  "I am, thanks to you.": "",
  "Let me know if there's anything I can do for you, okay?": "",
  "You have my thanks.": "",
  "Spending time with you like this is quite enjoyable. I hope we can do it more often, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Yeah, I agree. Let's see if this calamity decides to come back! =P": "",
  "For sure!": "",
  "Yagami-san. Are you available to meet me right now?": "",
  "Nothing in particular. I just wanted to see you.": "",
  "(I wonder what's going on? This is pretty unusual for her.)": "",
  "Where should we meet up?": "",
  "I feel bad for imposing on you, so why don't I head over to your office?": "",
  "Okay, I'll be waiting.": "",
  "Sorry, now's not a good time. I'll get back to you when I'm free.": "",
  "I see. I'll be waiting for your call, then.": "",
  "Did you get your powers back?": "",
  "(No response...)": "",
  "(I know she suggested that we stay away from each other, but... I'll try contacting her again later.)": "",
  "Amane-san. How's everything lately?": "",
  "(Really? She still won't talk to me?)": "",
  "Amane-san?": "",
  "Is everything okay?": "",
  "I noticed you haven't said anything.": "",
  "(Damn. She's really walled herself off...)": "",
  "I noticed you haven't been responding, and I understand why. All I want to know is that you're okay.": "",
  "Please. I just want to make sure nothing bad's happened to you.": "",
  "I've been worried.": "",
  "Amane-san!": "",
  "Can we talk now?": "",
  "Meet me at the usual spot, then? The bowling place by Theater Square?": "",
  "(I'm glad that I at least got something out of her. Hopefully she shows up...)": "",
  "(Should I invite Tsumugi-san out on a date?)": "",
  "Tsumugi-san, are you free?": "",
  "If it's for you, then certainly. <symbol=message_happy1>": "",
  "Great. I'll meet you at Theater Square, then? In front of the bowling spot, as usual.": "",
  "Then I'll be there right away.": "",
  "(Oh, should I buy a present for Tsumugi-san before our date?)": "",
  "I didn't realize you were so traditional. Very well, I shall wear it for you.": "",
  "Thanks for coming out today, Amane-san. Let's hang out again soon.": "",
  "Hanging out, you say? Interesting. To me, it was all business.": "",
  "Ah. I'll keep that in mind.": "",
  "Talk to you later, then.": "",
  "We talked about meeting up the other day, but are you available right now?": "",
  "Yes! Absolutely.": "",
  "Cool. Then let's meet up at Theater Square.": "",
  "Sure, now's a good time!": "",
  "Excellent! I look forward to seeing you.": "",
  "You said you wanted to talk? I'm free now if you are.": "",
  "Nasugawa": "",
  "Yagami-san, the route I took today was...": "",
  "I started by walking all the way down Tenkaichi Street, and at the end I made a right...": "",
  "Then I stopped at M Side Cafe. After that, I went down Theater Avenue, passed the Batting Center, and arrived at work.": "",
  "Got it. I'll go search that route.": "",
  "Hey, I got your package.": "",
  "Thanks a ton! Can you swing it by Mantai?": "",
  "On my way.": "",
  "Bad news, Yagami-san! One of the Keihin Gang leaders is looking for you... and he brought his posse with him!": "",
  "Eventually they got fed up with waiting for you to appear, so they decided to rough up everyone in the vicinity instead! Please put a stop to their wanton violence!": "",
  "Help! One of the Keihin Gang leaders rounded up a bunch of goons and started wreaking havoc in the streets!": "",
  "None of them will quit until they find you, so please! Don't let any more people get hurt!": "",
  "Look out, Yagami-san! One of the leaders for the Keihin Gang brought his men to come after you!": "",
  "And you know what they did? They beat my friend black and blue, all because he said he might've seen you!": "",
  "Please, is there anything you can do to help!?": "",
  "Yagami-san, come quick! One of my friends got hurt really bad by a Keihin Gang leader who said he was looking for you!": "",
  "He's got his whole crew with him, so please be careful! But I believe in you! I believe you can save us!": "",
  "Bad news, Yagami-san! The Keihin Gang is back to causing chaos in town!": "",
  "If you have the time, can you please help before someone gets hurt!?": "",
  "Good work, Yagami-san! Way to send those Keihin thugs packing!": "",
  "Everyone in town is practically cheering your name at this point.": "",
  "So, we decided to leave you a little token of our gratitude.": "",
  "Check the delivery box in front of your office! It should still be in there.": "",
  "Yagami-san, you made that Keihin leader look like a total sissy!": "",
  "Now we finally can go about our business in peace. Thank you so much!": "",
  "By the way, I left you something in your delivery box right outside your office.": "",
  "Please accept it along with my utmost gratitude!": "",
  "Thanks for kicking those Keihin guys to the curb!": "",
  "You have no idea how grateful we are to see them gone...": "",
  "There should be a gift waiting for you in the delivery box right outside your office.": "",
  "I hope you find it useful!": "",
  "Way to go, Yagami-san! You practically made that Keihin Gang leader run away crying!": "",
  "It really feels good to have our old city back.": "",
  "There should be something waiting for you in the delivery box right outside your office.": "",
  "We all just felt the need to thank you for everything you've done for us!": "",
  "Apparently that Keihin Gang leader up and left town. But that doesn't change the fact that he injured a lot of good people. Including some of my dearest friends.": "",
  "I thought you were gonna teach them a lesson. What gives?": "",
  "So this Keihin leader just did whatever the hell he wanted and then decided to skip town. What a jackass.": "",
  "Wish I could've seen the look on his face when he realized the jig was up. Yagami-san, if you ever see him around again, make sure to show him who's boss!": "",
  "So that Keihin leader and his cronies finally skipped town, but not before landing one of my friends in the hospital.": "",
  "No one had the courage or strength to stand up to them... but I believe you do.": "",
  "Guess that Keihin Gang leader went somewhere else to cause trouble. But at this point, the damage has already been done... Scores of innocent people are still left crying over their injuries as I send this.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I think you should help out your fellow townspeople next time.": "",
  "Takayuki-san. Thank you so much for today. I had a wonderful time.": "",
  "I did too. Maybe we can hang out again soon?": "",
  "That'd be great! There's so much I want to talk about with you...": "",
  "(Should I invite Sana-chan out?)": "",
  "(All right. Let's see what she says.)": "",
  "Sana-chan, are you free right now?": "",
  "I am! Wanna go somewhere?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
